# Settings while TV mode is on (#991): never the desktop window.  A game is loaded and TV mode is on: Ctrl+, opens the in-game menu
# (paused, as F4 does) with the Settings screen in its slot; a second press changes nothing; B leaves the slot for the menu root and
# B again resumes.  With TV mode off Ctrl+, is the desktop window again (and toggles it).
